      "position": [
        -600,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ghamalim guide 3: Channels, media, labels\nEverything here only reads data. Click **Execute workflow**.\n\nThese are the lookups you use to fill in other steps: which channels exist and what each can do, WhatsApp templates, TikTok rules, labels for posts, and media you have used before.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ccb945b5-1eb7-4e1f-b619-d03b0d77d148",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Channels and what they can do\n**Get Many** lists every connected channel. `capabilities.api` tells you what this node can do on it: `publish_posts`, `send_text`, `send_media`, `moderate_comments`. **Get** returns one (LINE also shows its monthly message quota).",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "895445be-273b-4c35-9f17-94c2ff1fa590",
